<title>FRANCE: Block of 50,000 Elf shares traded.</title>
<headline>Block of 50,000 Elf shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 50,000 shares in oil company Elf Aquitaine were traded on Tuesday morning at 414 francs per share on the Paris bourse, traders said.</p>
<p>The share was down 1.84 percent at 411.60 francs at 1030 GMT, while the CAC-40 index was 1.12 percent lower.</p>
</text>
